    {
      "bbox": [
        259,
        872,
        1435,
        934
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "By the power vested in me as Mayor of the City of\nNew York, it is hereby ordered:",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.265,
          "min": -1.3579
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0099,
          "min": -0.0099
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.0062,
          "min": -0.1279
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 8830,
        "area_px": 74340,
        "density": 0.11878,
        "chars": 81,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 9.17
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        261,
        971,
        1454,
        1265
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. Purpose. Control of overtime is\nimportant for good government and overtime should be\napproved only in those instance where it is warranted and\nappropriate. Therefore, agency heads should curtail\novertime expenditures whenever possible to achieve necessary\neconomies. Further, it is necessary and desirable to\ncontrol overtime abuses which might arise and to equalize\nthe apportionment of overtime among similarly-titled\nemployees.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.2371,
          "min": -1.2523
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0053,
          "min": -0.0053
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 87,
          "mean": -0.0124,
          "min": -0.6941
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 53847,
        "area_px": 353115,
        "density": 0.15249,
        "chars": 441,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 8.19
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        259,
        1301,
        1435,
        1429
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 2. Each agency head shall be directly\nresponsible for assuring that the allocation of overtime is\ncontrolled in such a manner as to achieve the most economy\nand eliminate the possibility of abuse.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2174,
          "min": -1.0894
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0003,
          "min": -0.0003
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 42,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0032
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 23848,
        "area_px": 152220,
        "density": 0.15667,
        "chars": 204,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 8.55
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        261,
        1466,
        1375,
        1562
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 3. All of the provisions of this\nExecutive Order apply whether the employee receives paid\novertime or compensatory time.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2213,
          "min": -1.2754
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 27,
          "mean": -0.0006,
          "min": -0.0142
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 16111,
        "area_px": 107328,
        "density": 0.15011,
        "chars": 128,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 7.94
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        259,
        1599,
        1454,
        1761
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 4. Approval for overtime shall be given\nonly when the operations of the agency clearly demand it.\nAll overtime must be approved in writing by the agency head\nor a representative of the agency head who is delegated such\nauthority in writing.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2015,
          "min": -1.1553
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 51,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0045
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 29935,
        "area_px": 195437,
        "density": 0.15317,
        "chars": 248,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 8.28
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        259,
        1797,
        1435,
        1994
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 5. Where applicable, all overtime\ncompensation and authorization shall comply with the Fair\nLabor Standards Act, its subsequent amendments, collective\nbargaining agreements, and existing Citywide overtime\nregulations, including the civilian overtime cap set by the\nCitywide Agreement.",
